632 0 obj
<<
/A 3237 0 R
/Alt (shows a schematic visualization of two types of brokerage chains, one on the top, one on the bottom of the figure. The broker is visualized as a circle in the center of each chain, connected by a line to two similar-issue protest episodes, shown as solid dark rectangles, or to two different-issue protest episodes, shown as solid dark and shaded rectangles. In each of the two brokerage chains, one other individual protester, visualized as a circle, is connected by a line to each of the two protest episodes. Thus, the Figure shows how other individuals are connected to the broker via their co-participation in protest episodes.)
/K 15
/P 631 0 R
/Pg 21 0 R
/S /Figure
/Type /StructElem
>>
